msgid "</button></form></div><details class=\"wd-sync-scope\"><summary>Synchronization scope and stock</summary><p class=\"wd-manual-note\">Full synchronization processes products, contacts and then orders, only in the selected direction. Identical copies are skipped; conflicts are flagged without overwriting. Variations, images and allowed fields follow their products. Login accounts remain optional. Existing product quantities continue to use stock events; this action does not force an inventory count.</p></details><noscript>JavaScript is required to run full batches. Individual actions remain available.</noscript><section id=\"wd-sync-progress\" hidden aria-label=\"Synchronization progress\"><strong data-sync-status role=\"status\"></strong><progress></progress><button type=\"button\" data-sync-stop class=\"button btn btn-default\">Stop after the current record</button><button type=\"button\" data-sync-copy class=\"button btn btn-default\">Copy log</button><pre data-sync-log></pre><p>Keep this page open. Stopping retains processed records; restarting skips records already synchronized.</p></section>"
msgstr ""

msgid "</code>. Enable the proxy in your Shopify app and configure the same path. Signed-in customers can only view their own linked account; balances are read from KerAwen through Commerce Pro.</p>"
msgstr ""

msgid "</div><p class=\"wd-manual-note\">Comparing changes nothing. Manual synchronization applies only the selected order and its contact details to the indicated store, even in stopped or audit mode, without enabling automatic tracking. A configured connection and write permission at the destination are required. Checkout drafts are excluded.</p>"
msgstr ""

msgid "</form><p><small>Only the key, store type, store URL, partner store URL and module version are sent to plugins.inklura.fr once a day. No catalogue, order or customer data is sent.</small></p></div>"
msgstr ""

