msgid "</table><h2>Linked customer accounts</h2><p>Optional native accounts have their own password. An email address already in use requires manual review. Guests, passwords and marketing consent are never copied.</p><table class=\"widefat table\"><tr><th>Source customer</th><th>Local account (ID)</th></tr>"
