msgid "</table><p>Run the supplied worker every minute. The health command exit code can be used by hosting monitoring. Stock synchronizes asynchronously: two simultaneous sales of the last item require a shared reservation service.</p>"
msgstr ""

msgid "</tbody></table><h2>Catalogue</h2><p>Latest transmitted snapshots; unknown stock does not mean zero stock. Displays up to 200 products; this is a report limit, not a synchronization cap.</p><table class=\"widefat\"><thead><tr>"
msgstr ""

msgid "</tbody></table><h2>Customer contacts</h2><p>Read-only copies: edit them in their source store. This contact view does not copy accounts, passwords or marketing consent; email is never used to merge records. Displays up to 200 contacts.</p><table class=\"widefat\"><thead><tr>"
msgstr ""

msgid "</tbody></table><h2>Orders</h2><p>Unlinked historical lines retain their original details; catalogue links are created when the product becomes available.</p><table class=\"widefat\"><thead><tr>"
msgstr ""

msgid "</tbody></table><p><button type=\"button\" class=\"button\" id=\"wd29-add-field\">Add field</button> <button class=\"button button-primary\" name=\"bridge_action\" value=\"save_field_rows\">Save fields</button></p></form>"
msgstr ""

msgid "</tbody></table><p>Blank secret fields retain their saved value. The app secret also verifies webhooks. The own-organization flow requires an app installed on a store in that same organization.</p><p>Only one location is synchronized. Currency and tax-inclusive/exclusive pricing must match. The catalogue imports titles, descriptions, options, references, barcodes and prices. Simultaneous changes, removals and structural changes are flagged for review. Linked customer names, email addresses and phone numbers are synchronized. The default Shopify address maps to WooCommerce billing; its export is configured separately. Additional addresses and the WooCommerce shipping address remain separate. Exporting new records requires both directions mode; new records use a unique identifier, without matching by email or reference.</p><p>Compatible ordinary discount codes synchronize separately: percentage, fixed cart or fixed product amount, all products and customers, without usage limits, stacking or additional conditions. A rule that becomes incompatible pauses its copy; shared usage limits must not be duplicated. Shopify gift cards, credit notes and points are not linked to the KerAwen balance. New simple and variable products can be exported; variations must have explicit options, without an any value.</p>"
msgstr ""

msgid "<br>Read-only copy: manage payments, refunds and shipments on Shopify.</p>"
msgstr ""

